{"des":"雪原中的阴影-接取步骤","script":"s_5_5_0","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]…………[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你……你们好……[l]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_4","text":"呃……"},{"tag":"tag_4","text":"你……你好？"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]非常抱歉打扰你们……我……有件事想请你们帮忙……[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]要帮忙倒是可以……不过你能不能先从柱子后面出来？你这样我们可没法好好说话啊。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]抱……抱歉……是我太失礼了。请不要误会……我……我只是有些害怕而已。[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]没事，我们不会嘲笑你的，有什么请求尽管说就好了。[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]好、好的……就是我……我发现阿莱琳娜最近有些奇怪，我想她可能是遇到什么麻烦了……我想帮她解决掉麻烦！[l]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_11","text":"阿莱琳娜？"},{"tag":"tag_11","text":"你说的是谁？"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]啊——抱、抱歉！阿莱琳娜就是……你们看，对面的那位穿着特别大胆的女孩。她是我从小玩到大的好朋友……[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]……噢，那个打扮得特别张扬的女孩是吧，我们看到了……这冰天雪地的还穿这么少，不冷吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]是的……她总是这样特立独行，充满活力。即便她的行为让很多人都不理解，但我能懂。每次见到她时，我的心灵总能得到治愈。[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这世界上怎么会有这么完美的女孩子……如果她是天上的月亮，那我就是永远在她身旁闪烁的一颗不起眼的小星星……[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_15"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]呃……等等……你怎么突然开始吟起诗来了？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_16"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]抱、抱歉，我有些得意忘形了……总之我想说的是，她的穿着和行为虽然都很前卫，但她绝不是那种轻浮随便的女孩。[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_17"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]但她今天的表现有点奇怪……不但故意装成娇滴滴的样子，还……还总想拉着人去旅舍！她原本才不是这样的，一定……一定是遇到什么麻烦了！[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_18"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这个……是这么回事啊。不过你真的确定她遇到了什么麻烦吗？万一……我是说万一哈，她就是那样的人呢。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_19"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不可能！请相信我！虽然她经常被纪律委员叫去谈话、在路上惊动院长、还总带着其他同学开演唱会，但她绝对不是那种人！[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_20"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这听起来怎么更不靠谱了……[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_21"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不过这确实不算什么过分的事情，但还有一个问题——这种小事……也不需要我们出手吧？你自己去找她不就行了。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_22"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我感觉这件事情没那么简单……背后恐怕有难以言说的隐情。而且……而且……我也不好意思开口问她这种事情……[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_23"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这有什么不好意思的……算了，问个问题也不麻烦，我们这就帮你去问吧。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_24"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]真的吗？太……太感谢你们了！[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_25"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]阿莱琳娜还在那边，你们直接去找她就行了，我……我会在后面看着的。不过……还请你们不要告诉她，是我请你们去的……[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_26"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嗯，请放心，我们会替你保守好秘密的。[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_27"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para"